description:
Develop a 16-bit to 32-bit signed data extender. The module takes a 16-bit input and extends it to 32 bits by replicating the most significant bit (bit 15) of the input to fill the upper 16 bits of the output, ensuring that the sign of the original value is preserved.
module top_module(
	data_i,
	data_o
);

code:
module top_module(
	data_i,
	data_o
);input [15:0] data_i;
output wire [31:0] data_o;
assign data_o = {{16{data_i[15]}},data_i};
endmodule

