Design a 3-bit shift register that captures the input signal 'in' on the rising edge of the clock. The register shifts its contents to the left with each clock cycle, discarding the least significant bit and inserting the new input 'in' at the least significant position. The output 'out' reflects the most significant bit of the shift register.
module top_module(
  input clock,
  input in,
  output out
);

