description:
Implement a binary to binary-coded decimal (BCD) converter. The module takes a 4-bit binary input and, upon receiving a start signal, converts the binary number into its BCD representation. The conversion adjusts the output based on the value of the binary input, adding specific BCD adjustments as needed to ensure proper encoding. The resulting BCD value is provided as a 4-bit output.
module top_module(
    input [3:0] bin,
    input start,
    output reg [3:0] bcd
);

